      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**98. 速度合成的相对论定律**"
      ],
      "stableTargets": []
    },
    {
      "sourceOrder": 1,
      "ref": "p0262#3",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "速度合成的新定律是符合于空间和时间的相对论新概念",
        "的. 很明显，速度合成的经典定律不可能是正确的，因为它与",
        "真空中光速是恒量的论点相矛盾."
      ],
      "stableTargets": [
        "lesson.prose[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceOrder": 2,
      "ref": "p0262#4",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果火车以速度 $v$ 运行，并且在车厢中在火车运动的方",
        "向上有一光波传播着，则光波相对于地球的速度应当仍然还",
        "是 $c$，**而不是** $v+c$. 速度合成的新定律也应该导出所要求的",
        "结果."
      ],
      "stableTargets": [
        "lesson.prose[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceOrder": 3,
      "ref": "p0262#5",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们写出（不加证明）个别情况下的速度合成定律：*当物*",
        "*体沿参考系 $K_1$ 的轴运动，而参考系 $K_1$ 又相对于参考系 $K$ 以*",
        "*速度 $v$ 运动，并且，在运动过程中坐标轴 $X$ 与 $X_1$ 始终是重合*"
      ],
      "stableTargets": [
        "lesson.prose[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceOrder": 4,
      "ref": "p0262#6",
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "图 226",
      "box": [
        829,
        1429,
        484,
        285
      ],
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [],
      "id": "fig-226",
      "stableTargets": [
        "lesson.prose[3]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceOrder": 5,
      "ref": "p0262#7",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "*的，而坐标轴 $Y$ 和 $Y_1$，$Z$ 和 $Z_1$ 始*",
        "*终是保持平行的（图 226）.*"
      ],
      "stableTargets": [
        "lesson.prose[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceOrder": 6,
      "ref": "p0262#8",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们用 $v_1$ 表示*物体相对于*",
        "*$K_1$ 的速度*，用 $v_2$ 表示*此物体相*",
        "*对于 $K$ 的速度*. 这时根据速度合",
        "成的相对论定律"
      ],
      "stableTargets": [
        "lesson.prose[4]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceOrder": 7,
      "ref": "p0262#9",
      "kind": "cap",
      "label": "图 226",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": true,
      "lines": [
        "图 226"
      ],
      "stableTargets": [
        "lesson.prose[5]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceOrder": 8,
      "ref": "p0262#10",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$v_2=\\frac{v_1+v}{1+\\frac{v_1v}{c^2}}$　（8.6）"
      ],
      "stableTargets": [
        "lesson.prose[4]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceOrder": 9,
      "ref": "p0263#1",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果 $v\\ll c$，$v_1\\ll c$，则项 $\\frac{v_1v}{c^2}$ 在分母中可以忽略不计，我们",
        "得出的不是(8.6)式，而是速度合成的经典定律：",
        "$v_2=v_1+v$"
      ],
      "stableTargets": [
        "lesson.prose[6]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceOrder": 10,
      "ref": "p0263#2",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "当 $v_1=c$ 时，速度 $v_2$ 也等于 $c$，正如相对论第二假设要求",
        "的那样，确实是，",
        "$v_2=\\frac{c+v}{1+\\frac{cv}{c^2}}=c\\frac{c+v}{c+v}=c$"
      ],
      "stableTargets": [
        "lesson.prose[7]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceOrder": 11,
      "ref": "p0263#3",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "速度合成的相对论定律的突出性质是，在速度 $v_1$ 和 $v$ 为",
        "任何值时(当然不能大于 $c$)合速度 $v_2$ 不超过 $c$，在极限情况",
        "下，当 $v_1=v=c$ 时，可得",
        "$v_2=\\frac{2c}{2}=c$"
      ],
      "stableTargets": [
        "lesson.prose[8]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceOrder": 12,
      "ref": "p0263#4",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "速度 $v>c$ 是不可能的. 当 $v>c$ 时，公式(8.1)和(8.2)",
        "就失去意义，因为时间和长度变为虚数了."
      ],
      "stableTargets": [
        "lesson.prose[9]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceOrder": 13,
      "ref": "p0263#5",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**光速是自然界中传递相互作用的最大可能速度.**"
      ],
      "stableTargets": [
        "lesson.prose[10]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceOrder": 14,
      "ref": "p0263#6",
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
